  "spec": "Embed an ACP client; the chat panel sends {user message + live tree context} to the harness and renders the reply (message, thought, plan, and tool_call streams). Proposed edits in the reply are passed to the draft pipeline via plumbed permission seams. Transport is abstracted: DevSidecarHarnessClient (WebSocket over dev-server) for development, MossHarnessClient (Weave host API) for production.",
