M2.5 builds not accepting tool calls despite supporting them — confirm the 8b-a1b build enables it.\n\nThe binding constraint stays tool-calling fidelity: can LFM2-8B-A1B emit a well-formed propose_edits ProjectDiff for a small tree?",
